&lt;p&gt;It’s been more than twenty years since Aditi and Akash dated, and lost touch with each other. After reconnecting online one day, they plan to meet each other in Delhi &amp;ndash; and spend half a day walking down Delhi and their own memory lanes.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>